    <h2>For builders, designers and electricians</h2>
    <p>Selections are the part of a build that eats your time and generates change orders. Send your clients here and we'll take that off your plate: we'll walk them through every fixture, keep them honest about their allowance, and hand you back a clean list — quantities, finishes, model numbers, and anything with a lead time that could touch your schedule. Then we receive it, check it, and hold it until you're ready for it.</p>
    <p>Dozens of builders around Bryan–College Station already work with us this way. If we haven't worked together yet, we'd like to. Come by, or call <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneE164 }}">{{ site.phone }}</a> and ask for Becca.</p>
